# Force LF everywhere. DVC 3 hashes raw bytes: a committed `cache: false` output
# (metrics/metrics.json, models/run.json) checked out with CRLF on Windows gets a
# different md5 than the one in dvc.lock, and `dvc repro` would re-run stages on a
# fresh clone even though nothing changed.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.joblib binary
